<title>KUWAIT: Kuwait says oil pipe leak at Burgan, output normal.</title>
<headline>Kuwait says oil pipe leak at Burgan, output normal.</headline>
<dateline>KUWAIT 1997-05-20</dateline>
<text>
<p>Kuwait Oil Co on Tuesday reported a leakage accident in an oil pipe at the huge Burgan oilfield but said it did not disrupt production, the official news agency KUNA said.</p>
<p>It quoted a company official as saying the leakage was slight and had been brought under control.</p>
<p>The leakage came from a pipe attached to gathering centre number four at Burgan, Kuwait's biggest oilfield which contains some 60 billion barrels of crude.</p>
</text>
